WEBVTT

00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:03.590
to drift along in the breeze,
and I think that's a pity.

00:02:03.614 --> 00:02:05.976
I think we should perhaps
do a bit more of it.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.996
I think we should be a bit
more willing, perhaps,

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.939
to look at the beautiful sight
of the sunlight bursting out

00:02:12.963 --> 00:02:16.405
from behind the clouds
and go, "Wait a minute,

00:02:16.429 --> 00:02:18.744
that's two cats dancing the salsa!"

00:02:18.768 --> 00:02:20.141
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:02:20.165 --> 00:02:25.907
Or seeing the big, white,
puffy one up there

00:02:25.931 --> 00:02:27.829
over the shopping center looks like

00:02:27.853 --> 00:02:31.462
the Abominable Snowman
going to rob a bank.